\(\\mathsf{Strict}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 均采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" href=\"?note=ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" title=\"16-thm-term-model-initial\">16-thm-term-model-initial</a> 明确限定的有限强一阶片段及严格模型接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 取规范定理 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" href=\"?note=ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" title=\"16-thm-term-model-initial\">16-thm-term-model-initial</a> 引用的模型谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal T_\\Sigma)\\ \\land\\\n(\\forall M)\\bigl(\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longrightarrow(\\exists!F)\\ \\mathsf{Strict}_\\Sigma(F;\\mathcal T_\\Sigma,M)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal T_\\Sigma)\\ \\land\\\n(\\forall M)\\bigl(\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longrightarrow(\\exists!F)\\ \\mathsf{Strict}_\\Sigma(F;\\mathcal T_\\Sigma,M)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>规范陈述、逐结构保持条件和完整归纳证明见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" href=\"?note=ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" title=\"16-thm-term-model-initial\">16-thm-term-model-initial</a>。这里不把伪态射或任意 LCCC 函子并入唯一性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-thm-term-model-initial","status":"resolved","id":"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-term-model-initial]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-term-model-initial","status":"resolved","id":"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正